  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "In a blender or food processor, blend the chickpeas, onion, parsley, cilantro, garlic, lemon juice, salt, and black pepper until coarsely chopped.",
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the chickpea mixture to the skillet and cook, stirring occasionally, for 5 minutes.",
    "Warm the pita breads by wrapping them in foil and heating them in the oven for 5 minutes.",
    "Assemble the wraps by spooning the chickpea mixture onto each pita bread, followed by a sprinkle of feta cheese (if using)."
